{
  "id": "770",
  "title": "Completely Drenched",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-12-13",
  "synopsis": "Paul got soaking wet in the rain, so he’s “like a drenched chicken”.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/770/f5e96ca47840fcf6fc2d1d2826c377a637fac52f.mp3?1575893238",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "落汤鸡\n\n小乐：天啊！你都成落汤鸡了！你不是带伞了吗？\n保罗：别提了！我把伞放在超市外面，然后进超市买鸡，出来发现伞不见了！\n小乐：你可以再回超市买一把伞啊！\n保罗：雨太大了，超市的伞卖完了，我只能被雨淋成落汤鸡了。\n小乐：真是辛苦你了！赶紧用毛巾擦擦。把鸡给我吧！今晚我做鸡汤给你喝，暖暖身子，可别感冒了。\n保罗：呀，我的鸡呢？啊！对不起，我出超市后找伞，把鸡落在超市了。我现在回去拿。\n小乐：算了，别去了。我煮点姜汤给你喝吧！",
    "traditional": "落湯雞\n\n小樂：天啊！你都成落湯雞了！你不是帶傘了嗎？\n保羅：別提了！我把傘放在超市外面，然後進超市買雞，出來發現傘不見了！\n小樂：你可以再回超市買一把傘啊！\n保羅：雨太大了，超市的傘賣完了，我只能被雨淋成落湯雞了。\n小樂：真是辛苦你了！趕緊用毛巾擦擦。把雞給我吧！今晚我做雞湯給你喝，暖暖身子，可別感冒了。\n保羅：呀，我的雞呢？啊！對不起，我出超市後找傘，把雞落在超市了。我現在回去拿。\n小樂：算了，別去了。我煮點薑湯給你喝吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Completely Drenched"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：天啊！你都成落汤鸡了！你不是带伞了吗？",
      "traditional": "小樂：天啊！你都成落湯雞了！你不是帶傘了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè tiān a nǐ dōu chéng luò tāng jī le nǐ bú shì dài sǎn le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Heavens! You’ve gotten completely drenched! Didn’t you bring an umbrella?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：别提了！",
      "traditional": "保羅：別提了！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó bié tí le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我把伞放在超市外面，然后进超市买鸡，",
      "traditional": "我把傘放在超市外面，然後進超市買雞，",
      "pinyin": "wǒ bǎ sǎn fàng zài chāo shì wài miàn rán hòu jìn chāo shì mǎi jī",
      "english": "Paul: Don’t bring it up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "出来发现伞不见了！",
      "traditional": "出來發現傘不見了！",
      "pinyin": "chū lái fā xiàn sǎn bú jiàn le",
      "english": "I put the umbrella outside the supermarket, then went into the supermarket to buy chicken, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ".. then came out to discover that the umbrella was nowhere to be seen!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：你可以再回超市买一把伞啊！",
      "traditional": "小樂：你可以再回超市買一把傘啊！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ kě yǐ zài huí chāo shì mǎi yì bǎ sǎn a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: You could have gone back in the supermarket again and bought an umbrella!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：雨太大了，超市的伞卖完了，",
      "traditional": "保羅：雨太大了，超市的傘賣完了，",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó yǔ tài dà le chāo shì de sǎn mài wán le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "我只能被雨淋成落汤鸡了。",
      "traditional": "我只能被雨淋成落湯雞了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ zhǐ néng bèi yǔ lín chéng luò tāng jī le",
      "english": "Paul: The rain was so heavy that the supermarket umbrellas were sold out."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I had no other choice but to get soaked by the pouring rain."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小乐：真是辛苦你了！赶紧用毛巾擦擦。",
      "traditional": "小樂：真是辛苦你了！趕緊用毛巾擦擦。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zhēn shì xīn kǔ nǐ le gǎn jǐn yòng máo jīn cā cā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "把鸡给我吧！今晚我做鸡汤给你喝，暖暖身子，可别感冒了。",
      "traditional": "把雞給我吧！今晚我做雞湯給你喝，暖暖身子，可別感冒了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎ jī gěi wǒ ba jīn wǎn wǒ zuò jī tāng gěi nǐ hē nuǎn nuǎn shēn zi kě bié gǎn mào le",
      "english": "Little Le: That was really hard on you! Quickly use a towel to wipe yourself."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Give me the chicken! Tonight I’ll make chicken soup for you to drink, it’ll warm up the body. Let’s hope you won’t catch a cold."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "保罗：呀，我的鸡呢？",
      "traditional": "保羅：呀，我的雞呢？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó ya wǒ de jī ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "啊！对不起，我出超市后找伞，把鸡落在超市了。",
      "traditional": "啊！對不起，我出超市後找傘，把雞落在超市了。",
      "pinyin": "a duì bu qǐ wǒ chū chāo shì hòu zhǎo sǎn bǎ jī là zài chāo shì le",
      "english": "Paul: Oh, my chicken?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "我现在回去拿。",
      "traditional": "我現在回去拿。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiàn zài huí qù ná",
      "english": "Ah! I’m sorry, after I went out of the supermarket to look for the umbrella, I left the chicken at the supermarket."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’ll go back and get it now."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "小乐：算了，别去了。我煮点姜汤给你喝吧！",
      "traditional": "小樂：算了，別去了。我煮點薑湯給你喝吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè suàn le bié qù le wǒ zhǔ diǎn jiāng tāng gěi nǐ hē ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Forget it, don’t go. I’ll boil a bit of hot ginger water for you to drink!"
    }
  ],
